  historic garden center. This one-hour performance will feature works by l
 ocal choreographers Amanda Gabaldon\, Cindy Hennessy\, and Susan Taylor Le
 nnon\, as well as reading by poet\, Gianna Russo. Doors open at 1:30pm\, a
 nd tickets can be purchased online. Seating is limited. \n\nPermalink: htt
