SUMMARY:The Art of Decadence: Sip Paint Night Experience
LOCATION:510 Water St Tampa \, FL 33602 United States
DESCRIPTION:An Intimate Art Night Mixed-Media Experience with Sir Nicholas
  Lucius. For one unforgettable evening\, Driftlight Steakhouse becomes a j
 ewel box of contemporary art\, chilled ros\, beautiful bites\, and uninhib
 ited artistry. Step inside the dazzlingly maximalist world of Sir Nicholas
  Lucius\, the Tampa Baybased contemporary artist. Celebrated for his richl
 y layered fusion of painting\, collage\, fashion\, fantasy\, crystals\, an
 d hand-applied embellishment\, Lucius invites just 20 guests to experience
  his creative universe from the inside. Part intimate artist salon. Part c
 ollector preview. Part hands-on atelier. Entirely Lucius. Under the artist
 s personal guidance\, each guest will transform a canvas into a one-of-one
  objet dart using a specially curated archive of Lucius imagery\, layered 
 collage\, expressive painterly interventions\, Swarovski crystals\, pearls
 \, and luminous embellishments. No previous artistic experience is require
 donly curiosity\, imagination\, and the desire to create something extraor
 dinary. Between layers\, guests will sip Whispering Angel Ros\, enjoy artf
 ully crafted cocktails and chef-curated hors doeuvres\, and explore a salo
 n-style presentation of original Sir Nicholas Lucius artworks available fo
 r private acquisition. The evening will also offer an exclusive first look
  at HAUS OF LUCIUS\, the artists first fully immersive art experience debu
 ting this October at Art Fair Tampaan ambitious new world where contempora
 ry art\, fashion\, fantasy\, and self-invention converge. At the end of th
 e evening\, every guest will depart with their completed one-of-one canvas
 \, an invitation into the next chapter of HAUS OF LUCIUS\, and a beautiful
  reminder of what can happen when artistry and indulgence meet. The ros wi
 ll be chilled. The crystals will be sparkling. The evening will be anythin
 g but ordinary. Reserve your place now. \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.g
 ov/node/195031
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/195031
END:VEVENT
