 , share and explore collage techniques. If you are new to the concept\, ar
 e a seasoned cat\, or want to expand your practice\, there is something fo
 r everyone. All materials supplied\, just bring an open heart. And as alwa
 ys for community events\, feel free to bring something to share (refreshme
 nts\, bits of inspiration or extra stash). What is community day you ask? 
 It is Saturdays at the studio on Howard at our original locations. It is a
 n event space made for inspiring and creative adventures. In addition to c
 lasses\, we have workshops and meet ups for analog cats. Saturdays are mad
