SUMMARY:Spooktacular Science
LOCATION:4801 E Fowler Ave Tampa \, FL 33617-2017 United States
DESCRIPTION:Spooktacular Science delivers a thrilling night of science\, d
 iscovery\, and spooky fun at MOSI! Spark your curiosity with hands-on expe
 riments\, exciting demonstrations\, and Halloween-inspired experiences per
 fect for the whole family. Begin your adventure with a spooky cosmic journ
 ey in the Saunders Planetarium (https:mosi.orgexperiencesaunders-planetari
 um). Then\, satisfy your sweet tooth with festive Halloween flavors of Liq
 uid Nitrogen Ice Cream and creepy candy stations throughout the event. Con
 tinue exploring with frightfully fun entertainment\, hair-raising experime
 nts\, mysterious demonstrations\, and a variety of interactive activities 
 that bring science to life. Create your own slimy creations in the Potions
  Lab\, take control of a drone during a Phantom Flight adventure\, and enj
 oy a variety of food and drinks available for purchase. Make Spooktacular 
 Science your new favorite fall tradition at MOSI! \n\nPermalink: https://w
 ww.tampa.gov/node/193746
